{
  "file" : "npc/re/quests/pile_bunker.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "You are carrying so much. Drop off some of your luggage and come back to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "So how's that Pilebuncker working out for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "I'm a retired Mechanic and I don't think I have any business with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "So? What does it feel like to be on a Madogear?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "It's something that's not allowed for those who failed to seek out their own path."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Me? I retired a long time ago. Because I got into an accident... got badly hurt and won't be able to ride again. I am upset about it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "So I've decided to stay here forging gears for Madogear."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Huh? I'm not saying I have any complaints about this work."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Forced to do something you don't like, there is nothing more miserable than that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "There are people who are happy just being props, you know, like being the wall for someone to lean on."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "That makes me feel good and I am about to make a new gear. I want you to help me. What do you say?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "I am not that interested."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "What are you going to make?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Where do you get the materials?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "I brought the materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Nothing I can do"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "about it then."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "See you next time!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Um, a huge metal stick that could smash an opponent in one hit!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "It doesn't look fancy, but I've designed a spring-loaded device to attack with great strength."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "It's concealed, so when you find a chance, one shot could put an opponent in critical condition!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "I can't wait to see it in action!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "If you were to imagine how good this kind of weapon could be, I will make it come true."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Bring me 200 Steel, 30 Flexible Tubes, and 1 Brocca. I could make what I just described with those materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "You should be able get steel from many monsters like Kobolds."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Flexible Tubes are more rare, dropped by Metalings around Einbroch and Lighthalzen."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Lastly, finding a Brocca is very hard, but you should be able to do something about it. Haha, go get it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "You haven't brought all of the materials that I asked for."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "I have a habit of giving up what I've been making and trying to make new things when the inspiration comes up."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "You'd better hurry!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Oh, I've been waiting. You didn't come on time, so I was wondering if you forgot about it. Please wait there a little bit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "It's done. What do you think? Not bad, eh? Although I made it myself, I have to say it's pretty decently done."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Combination of weight, volume and look at its color and gloss. It catches my heart!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "..........."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Uh, with little improvement, it could be mass produced and delivered. I'm sure I can make more of these so I will give this one to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "[Gomer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Gomer",
      "text" : "Oh, and it turns out that I didn't need all that Steel after all. So here, take most of it back."
    }
  ]
}